WEBVTT

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:04.890
I'm s-so sorry, I didn't think things would turn out like this.

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:12.540
It's embarrassing, but the photos that we took of Nogizaka-san the other day got mixed up in the audition files,

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.850
and just went through the judging process.

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:15.830
Hahaha

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:17.310
hahaha

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:17.310
Oh...oh no...

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:19.550
I'm really, very sorry, hahaha.

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:20.180
Oh, uh...

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.180
You must've been so surprised to receive an acceptance letter all of the sudden.

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:26.180
Well, but if it's just a mistake...

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:29.180
We can just say that that letter's invalid, right?

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:31.640
Oh, um, actually...

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:32.080
Hm?

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.940
A-about that, Nogizaka-san...

00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:37.250
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:38.110
Y-yes?

00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:41.540
...if you can, will you actually participate in the audition?

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:42.260
Huh?

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:43.580
Um, what do you mean?

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:49.190
Just like I said, I want Nogizaka-sann to participate in the audition on February 14th.

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:49.980
Huh...?

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:53.170
Eehhh!?

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:53.170
Eehhh!?

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:29.710
("It's Gotten Like This...")

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:25.950
M-me...!?

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:27.130
In the audition...?

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:29.040
Wh-what is going on here!?

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:30.350
Oh, I-I'm sorry.

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:33.370
I guess we confused you guys...huh?

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:37.580
By participate, we don't mean for you to actually compete, but...

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:38.020
Huh?

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:39.840
Just to fulfill the number of participants.

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:40.830
Huh?

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:47.590
We accidentally entered you, but your name's already in the program and the invitations for the media,

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:49.460
so we can't really do anything...

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:54.470
We'll take you off from the selection process, and won't disturb your privacy, so.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:56.040
B-but...

00:02:57.470 --> 00:03:00.110
We'll support you as much as we can too!

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:03.820
Just in case, we'll have you take a little lesson before the audition...

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:04.690
Lesson?

00:03:04.690 --> 00:03:06.710
...but you'll be fine, Nogizaka-san!

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:09.420
Like singing, dancing, and acting...

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:11.000
Also, recording too.

00:03:11.780 --> 00:03:13.340
Recording...

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:16.150
Please,

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:17.630
please, I beg of you!

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:18.740
Please!

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:19.570
Please!

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:20.440
Please!

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:21.590
Oh...b-but...

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:21.480
Please!

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:22.130
Please!

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:23.950
Haruka, what do you want to do...?

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:25.420
Please!Please! Please!

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:28.580
Please! Please!

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:29.000
O-okay...

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.480
if it's within my capability...

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:32.680
R-really!?

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:35.080
Y-yes, if I'm good enough...

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:39.070
O-oh no! We want you, Nogizaka-san!

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:42.700
N-no, it's like we can't think of anyone but Nogizaka-san!

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:43.790
Thank you!

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:46.270
I will never forget what you've done for us!!

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:46.850
Ohh!

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:50.100
Uh...huh...haha...

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:51.210
Yay!

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:53.360
Haruka, are you really okay with this?

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:54.180
Thank you, thank you!

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:54.070
Yes.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:57.620
Right now, I'm not so busy with my lessons,

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:02.480
and Kayahara-san has been good to us, giving us the photos and things, so...

00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:04.880
Th-then Nozomi-chan...

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:05.490
Oh!

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:08.570
Contact the publicity group that we got an okay!

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:09.540
Okay~!

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:10.670
Nogizaka-san!

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:11.480
Huh!?

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:14.910
I don't mean to rush, but will you just go through the explanation process for the lessons?

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:16.620
It won't take too long.

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:17.730
Y-yes.

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:19.280
Okay, this way, this way!

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:19.180
Oh!

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:21.180
Yuuto-san!

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:22.730
Haruka!

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:24.060
Oh, uh, um!

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:25.820
Uh...

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:46.260
Oh, I'm sorry, Ayase-kun.

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:48.880
Could you step outside for a little bit?

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:49.450
Huh?

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:54.250
You know, if Ayase-kun's here, Nogizaka-san will be distracted, right?

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:56.630
Oh, r-right...

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:59.780
Just think about it a little, for her sake.

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:01.690
I...understand...

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:04.430
Oh...

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:13.140
I feel bad if I trouble Haruka...

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:13.790
Wah!

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:13.930
Ouch!

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:19.200
Hey, you!

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:22.240
Don't just stand there like a dumb obstacle!

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:22.860
What!

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:24.710
What's taking you so long!?

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:27.010
I asked you to get me something to drink!

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:28.190
Where is it!?

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:30.290
What do you think you are, manager!?

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:31.220
Huh!?!?

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:34.150
N-no, I'm not a manager or...

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:37.120
Never mind, just go, now!

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:40.860
What makes you think you can just leave me thirsty!?

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:42.860
If you heard me, just hurry up.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:45.370
A non-carbonated coke, within 3 minutes!

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:46.630
I told you, I'm...!

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:47.500
Shut up!

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:48.670
Don't talk back to me!

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:49.890
Just go, now!

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:50.940
Ugh...

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:56.070
Geez, she just doesn't make any sense...I can't converse with her.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.740
What the heck is she...?

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:04.970
...but I feel like I've seen her somewhere...

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:06.100
Ahh!!

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:08.950
Hey, you!

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:12.460
Don't just stand there like a dumb obstacle!

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:14.400
I owe you one, thank you.

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:17.970
That's right, from that time...

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:21.210
But why is she at a place like this?

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:28.590
Here you go.

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:32.750
You're so slow. I'll give you 30 points...

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:35.180
Of course, out of 500 points total.

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:36.460
Ugh uh...!

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:40.810
Wait, who are you...?

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:43.000
You don't look too familiar.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:44.220
Criminal?

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:45.500
Stalker?

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:47.180
Now you ask...?

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:50.830
I'm neither of those. I'm just waiting for someone.

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:52.260
Hmm...

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:55.580
Well, it doesn't really matter to me who you are!

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:58.800
....but you asked yourself...!

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.950
Hm? Hm...

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:03.990
Hello? Hey, you!

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.340
Where are you right...

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:06.980
huh?

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.940
You can't find a non-carbonated coke anywhere?

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:11.860
You're in Asakusa right now?

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:14.390
What? I don't get it at all!

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:16.210
Hey, wait a minute!

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:17.090
Ugh!

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:19.120
You can't just leave.

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:21.980
You didn't even excuse yourself with me!

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:23.840
Ughhh!

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:26.970
That's true, but what are you...!

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:30.330
Also, I have something for you to do now.

00:07:31.020 --> 00:07:36.850
You've been pretty good with the coke and all, so be my manager starting now.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:37.960
Huh?!?

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:39.650
It's like a part time job.

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:42.820
What can I do? We don't have enough people.

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:46.970
Geez, that stupid one-day manager is lost, too.

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:55.350
And I don't know but Yayoi and Nozomi are like, "We have something we just have to get done," and running around all over the place...

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:59.460
Everyone's just so useless around here!

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:01.130
That might be true, but why do I have to...

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:03.440
You got it!? This is already settled!

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:07.560
N-no, I'm waiting for someone...eh!?

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:09.430
Hm?

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:12.030
Did I not introduce myself yet?

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:14.150
I'm Himemiya Milan.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:17.520
I don't want to, but I'll try to tolerate it with you for now.

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:21.510
I have an interview and a photo shoot now.

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:24.010
I'll have you help me with that.

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:26.680
Wh-what are you talking about...?

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:30.170
I mean, are you really Himemiya Milan?

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:30.970
Yeek!?

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:32.740
Gahh...!

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:34.250
What kind of rude question is that!?

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.460
B-but you know...?

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:38.540
Well, I'm going to change, so get me my outfit!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:42.350
Waah!!

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:42.920
Hm...?

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:44.230
Wh-what are you doing!?

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:44.680
Huh...?

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:47.610
I don't even consider you as a guy, so it's fine.

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:49.250
Th-that's not the point...!

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:50.580
That is the point!

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:56.570
Besides, at lives and outside locations, I have to change at worse places.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:09:00.210
If I cared each time, I wouldn't be able to do this job!

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:02.520
I-is it that hard...?

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:03.730
Huh?

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:07.780
Wh-which outfit should I bring you?

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.490
Anything, I don't care.

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:13.170
It's for a teen magazine, so I'll just leave it to your taste.

00:09:13.420 --> 00:09:14.860
But then...

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:16.380
For teens, huh...?

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:17.980
Hmm....

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:19.460
Ehehe!

00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:20.870
Uhuhu!

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:22.530
Teehee!

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:24.160
Hm.

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:27.480
Huh...it looks pretty good.

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:30.190
You have pretty good taste for a face like that.

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:32.030
My face has nothing to do with it!

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:35.800
Oh yeah, I had one thing I wanted to ask you.

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:36.700
Hm?

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:40.670
You...what was your name?

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:44.120
People usually ask that first...

00:09:47.530 --> 00:09:49.160
Milan-chan, looking good!

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:49.910
Ehe!

00:09:50.510 --> 00:09:51.010
Aha!

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:52.820
It's perfect for the new single!

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:54.230
Teehee!

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:56.270
Okay, look this way...

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:58.650
What a difference...

00:09:58.650 --> 00:10:00.400
...Himemiya Milan, amazing...

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.000
Ahaha! Yay.

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:12.540
Cold! Wh-what do you want?

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:13.630
Drink it.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:14.580
Huh...?

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:16.490
It's a treat.

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:18.850
You kind of helped.

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:20.820
Oh...Th-thanks...

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:24.100
By the way,

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:26.580
didn't you say that you were waiting for someone?

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:27.920
Is that okay?

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:28.790
Oh,

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:31.260
no, it's probably not okay.

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:33.450
I hope the lesson's still going on...

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:34.500
Lesson?

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:38.790
They said it's necessary for the audition on February 14th.

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:41.620
Hmm...an audition, huh?

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:44.420
Is the one in charge Yayoi?

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:45.560
Yeah...

00:10:46.070 --> 00:10:52.060
Kayahara-san is kind of weird, but Haruka seems to trust her.

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:53.880
She's a good person.

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:57.460
Good person...huh...

00:10:58.340 --> 00:10:58.950
Hm?

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:00.840
Is there something about her?

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:03.980
Well, a little...

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:08.180
At first glance, she looks like she's an innocent and caring person,

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:12.540
and seems to be living just to help someone, but...

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:14.030
Hm,

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:20.170
it's just worse that she believes she really is that kind of person, so...

00:11:20.310 --> 00:11:20.840
Huh?

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:22.900
It's nothing.

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:25.520
It doesn't do anything even if I said something.

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:27.440
I don't have any reason to either...

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:29.350
Oh...

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:36.180
Haruka...!

00:11:37.640 --> 00:11:39.020
Oh, Ayase-kun,

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:40.290
you were still here?

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:41.640
Kayahara-san...

00:11:41.890 --> 00:11:45.920
Nogizaka-san finished her lesson, so I had Nozomi-chan take her home.

00:11:46.090 --> 00:11:46.560
Oh,

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:48.990
I see...

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:54.670
This plan...

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:57.240
can't be stopped by anyone...

00:11:57.490 --> 00:11:58.860
huhuhu...

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:03.860
(Thanks)

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:01.340
You gotta get this single!

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:08.870
(Non-carbonated!)

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:07.350
Coke definitely has to be non-carbonated!

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:11.250
I-I'm sorry about yesterday...

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:17.890
Kayahara-san told me that Yuuto-san went home, so I just left too...

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:19.400
No, don't worry.

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:22.520
I'm at fault too for stepping outside without saying anything.

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:24.580
Haruka, are you going to the lesson today too?

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:28.300
Yes, there's not that much time before the audition, so...

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:31.270
Um,Yuuto-san, for today...

00:12:31.860 --> 00:12:32.640
I...

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:38.450
If Ayase-kun's here, Nogizaka-san will be distracted, right?

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:41.960
Just think about it a little, for her sake.

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:46.510
...I'll pass for today, I don't want to get in the way.

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:49.890
I see...

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:51.310
But, I'll be rooting for you.

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:52.270
Good luck!

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:55.040
Yes! Thank you very much!

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:03.900
For Haruka's sake...right...?

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:04.950
Oh?

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:06.950
Who is it?

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:08.060
Hello?

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:08.670
Huh!?

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:09.880
Hey you, what are you doing!?

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:13.180
You're just a manager, and you're late, what are you thinking!?

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:15.400
Wh-why do you have my cell-phone number?

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:16.910
And you even set your own ringtone!?

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:19.630
That doesn't matter right now, just get here!

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:21.040
How useless! Geez!

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:24.830
M-my thoughts don't count, huh...?

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:17.190
It's already been a week...

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:18.970
the audition is...

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:20.270
Geez~!

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:20.650
Waaah!

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:22.600
What are you doing, onii-san!

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:23.480
Mi-Mika!

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:26.350
Valentine's just around the corner,

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:31.460
but Haruka-sama is busy with her lesson and Yuuto-sama is just focused on his manager work...

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:33.970
They are amazingly missing each other completely.

00:14:34.090 --> 00:14:35.090
koku koku

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.160
Wh-when did you guys get here?

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:37.830
You can't just leave it at this!

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:38.210
Huh?

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:43.760
Valentine's Day is an important day for couples to be lovey-dovey and sticky-touchy!

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:45.880
That doesn't sound right...

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:48.060
A-n-y-w-a-y-s!

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:51.240
It's definitely not okay for things to be this way!

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:54.080
So today, as a special offer,

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:58.820
Mika-chan Sensei will give you a practical lesson!

00:14:58.890 --> 00:15:05.150
Entitled: "How to spend a lovey-dovey Valentine's" for couples, angry-gale version!

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:06.000
Aha!

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:09.160
Don-don-hyuu-hyuu-pahu-pahu~!

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.160
Hyuu-hyuu-pahu-pahu.

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:11.800
Um...I don't feel so good about this...

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:11.400
Yo~ tada!

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:13.800
I'm home now~!

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:17.120
I'm hungry~!

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:19.970
Yuu-kun~feed me something~

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:20.710
Huh!?

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:20.710
Huh!?

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:22.440
(chocolate banana)

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:21.730
Huh?

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:23.680
Oh...

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:23.660
Uh...

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:23.750
Uh...

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:30.830
Yuuto...you...!

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:33.740
(chocolate banana)

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:33.230
Yuu-kun is...Yuu-kun is...

00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:39.300
making a little baby maid-chan lick a shining upright banana!

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:40.770
N-n-n-no! This isn't...!

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:42.590
Shut up, you super perverted guy-in-glasses!

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:43.030
Huh!?

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:45.160
I'll make you sorry!

00:15:51.270 --> 00:15:52.090
Yum yum...

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:58.670
Yuuto-san, are you okay?

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:01.740
You seemed uncomfortable all day today...

00:16:02.110 --> 00:16:07.560
Uh, yeah...thinking about last night, it's a miracle to still be alive...

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.850
P-please cheer up!

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:12.400
Um...and...

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:13.080
Hm?

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:16.930
Um...Yuuto-san...after the audition...

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:20.350
Do you have any plans...?

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:22.650
Uh, no, not really...

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:24.340
In that case, um...

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:28.020
after the audition, there's something I want to give you...

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:30.890
If you could give me some of your time...

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:32.300
Oh!

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:34.960
I-I got it. I'll keep it open.

00:16:36.150 --> 00:16:38.140
Th-thank you very much.

00:16:44.010 --> 00:16:45.650
What are you smirking about?

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:46.220
Oh!

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:51.270
Well, I don't know what happened, but just do your job, okay!?

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:54.680
Today's location is the af-reco studio in Shinjuku!

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:56.230
Huh? Af-reco?

00:16:56.690 --> 00:17:03.200
I'm singing the anime's theme song, so they want me to be in the anime too for that.

00:17:03.590 --> 00:17:06.880
Do you know about "Nocturne Girl's School Lacrosse Club"?

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:09.530
"N-Nocturne Girl's School"!?

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:18.940
So this is the af-reco studio...

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:21.200
Haruka would've loved to be here...

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:22.770
(February 4th (2nd floor) Nocturne Girl's School Lacrosse Club...)\

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:24.100
Alright!

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:30.060
Eehh! You're going to the af-reco for "Nocturne Girl's School Lacrosse Club"!?

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:33.520
Amazing, Yuuto, good job!

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:40.480
It'll be great if you could tell me which scenes are most important in "Nocturne Girl's School" and what I should be careful about at the af-reco studio...

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:44.630
also, what would be a good souvenir?

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:47.880
(Nocturne Girl's School Lacrosse Club)

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:49.430
Let's see...first, the important scene would definitely be the N's Five!

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:50.650
N's??

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:52.290
Noto Amiko-san,

00:17:52.770 --> 00:17:53.950
Gotou Mai-san,

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:55.760
Shimizu Kaori-san,

00:17:55.910 --> 00:17:56.940
Ueda Kana-san,

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:58.530
Sato Rina-san,

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:02.220
the super beautiful voice-actresses' unit~

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:06.830
You have to see their amazing acting skills.

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:13.430
Also, Takagi Reio-san, the super wonderful voice-actress, should be there too, so be careful not to fall in love with her!

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:13.400
(-Ueda  -Sato Rina -Takagi Reiko)

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:14.400
Also!

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.700
The thing you have to be careful about is to not be loud.

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:18.250
It's a professional location, so~

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:19.090
I see.

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:21.460
Also, for a souvenir, you should...!

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:25.960
It's finally complete, Mirage-Shot.

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:29.060
You've done well, Haruna-san.

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:31.110
Everyone too, great work.

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:32.480
Mizuki-sensei!!

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:34.000
Sensei!!

00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:34.000
Mizuki-sensei!!

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:38.870
But you can't just be playing lacrosse all the time; you guys are in high school.

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:41.560
Studies are the first priority.

00:18:42.690 --> 00:18:45.470
Aww...Mizuki-sensei's so strict~

00:18:45.510 --> 00:18:48.140
If you could let us go just for today~

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:49.370
Uhuhu!

00:18:50.030 --> 00:18:52.170
What~ you can't?

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:55.960
That's not good~ we don't have any other male voice-actors today~

00:18:56.230 --> 00:19:00.060
I'm so sorry! He suddenly got an appendicitis...

00:19:00.460 --> 00:19:01.690
Hmm...

00:19:01.230 --> 00:19:03.020
I'm so sorry!

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:04.970
What should we do...

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:07.510
Can anyone take his spot for us?

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:08.110
...hm?

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:08.920
Huh!?

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:12.370
N-no way!

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:14.770
I've never acted before!

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:17.200
It's okay! You can do it!

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:18.570
...I think!

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:19.810
Hah...

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:20.480
Oh...!

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:23.020
Well, if you're gonna do it, do it right.

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:24.140
I said I...!

00:19:24.060 --> 00:19:26.450
Okay, let's start with Cut 83.

00:19:25.150 --> 00:19:25.800
Uh...!

00:19:26.610 --> 00:19:28.690
The lizard, Emmanuel, go!

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:27.740
Huh....

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:30.140
Huh!?

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:32.690
Whatever!

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:34.310
Pigii!

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:36.870
Okay! We got it!

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:38.310
Huh?

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:40.250
Wow...

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:43.530
Huh?

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:44.730
Huh??

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:46.700
You're pretty good.

00:19:47.110 --> 00:19:49.700
I guess everyone has at least one talent.

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:54.050
Hehe!

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:56.460
(Nocturne Girl's School Lacrosse Club Episode 36)

00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:58.870
Today's performance fee... were you really okay with that?

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:02.530
Of course. This will make Haruka happy...

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:05.190
Okay then, see you tomorrow.

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:07.130
Don't be late!

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:08.540
I know.

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:21.280
Huh...? Is no one here?

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:26.620
Did Haruka leave already?...

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:27.490
hm?

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:36.530
Oh...!

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:39.810
Haruka-chan's angle here...this is the best.

00:20:38.930 --> 00:20:40.810
Can't be any better~

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:41.130
Yeah.

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:43.930
Oh, but this angle is good too~

00:20:43.170 --> 00:20:43.950
You're right.

00:20:44.110 --> 00:20:45.570
Nozomi-chan, what about this?

00:20:45.570 --> 00:20:46.860
Oh, that's good too.

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:50.860
Huh?

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:50.980
Oh??

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:54.520
Kayahara-san...is that...

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:56.800
Aw man, you caught us.

00:20:56.960 --> 00:21:01.150
I didn't want Ayase-kun to know about this at this point, but...

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:02.580
oh well...

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:05.610
We had to let you know at some point.

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:07.570
Wh-what's going on?

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:09.660
This is like...a real idol...

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:11.020
Yes...

00:21:11.390 --> 00:21:15.460
we're trying to have Haruka-chan debut as an idol.

00:21:16.030 --> 00:21:18.390
That story about the processing mistake is a lie...

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:22.940
After the audition on February 14th, Haruka-chan will become a real idol.

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:26.290
This is already decided.

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:27.840
So does that mean...

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:30.500
that the audition is a fake!?

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:33.120
Haruka-chan's talent is so magnificent.

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:35.730
I know it's a forceful method.

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:40.350
But, it's our mission to develop talent that should be known to the world!

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:41.480
B-but...!

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:43.950
This will help Haruka-chan, too!

00:21:46.520 --> 00:21:48.950
...does Haruka know about this?

00:21:50.260 --> 00:21:51.440
...well...

00:21:51.440 --> 00:21:52.830
Of course.

00:21:53.060 --> 00:21:56.650
Haruka-chan has accepted it and is really working hard.

00:21:56.830 --> 00:21:59.100
She's been doing very well with the lessons too.

00:21:59.350 --> 00:21:59.980
Oh...!

00:22:06.140 --> 00:22:07.950
Now do you understand?

00:22:08.500 --> 00:22:13.260
Okay then, I have two favors to ask of Ayase-kun about this...

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:17.420
One is that we want you to not say anything about today to Haruka-chan.

00:22:17.860 --> 00:22:22.700
If Haruka-chan found out that we've prepared this much already, it'll put pressure on her, right?

00:22:22.830 --> 00:22:24.200
Also, one more thing...

00:22:24.840 --> 00:22:28.380
for a while, could you keep a distance with Haruka-chan?

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:29.050
Huh...?

00:22:30.810 --> 00:22:32.410
I'll make it more clear.

00:22:33.100 --> 00:22:35.270
Could you stay away from Haruka-chan!?

00:22:38.530 --> 00:22:41.440
Stay away...from Haruka...?

00:24:14.640 --> 00:24:18.140
(Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals)

00:24:16.580 --> 00:24:19.310
Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals: Hatano Wataru.

00:24:18.160 --> 00:24:28.820
(Hatano Wataru)

00:24:19.430 --> 00:24:23.790
Documented as the male voice-actress that attacked men the most in the year 2009,

00:24:23.790 --> 00:24:26.410
AKA V-L New Last Emperor,

00:24:26.410 --> 00:24:28.700
otherwise called, the Smiling Groundwork Technique Magician.

00:24:28.820 --> 00:24:34.820
(Next: "I Want to Keep Feeling it...")

00:24:28.970 --> 00:24:32.900
Ayase Yuuto, the character he acts as, is the last hope for Nogizaka Haruka.

00:24:33.170 --> 00:24:34.680
I wish them luck...

00:24:34.820 --> 00:24:39.900
(See you next week!)

00:24:34.820 --> 00:24:39.900
(Nogizaka Haruka no Himitsu Purezza)
